    :selection "balanced ≥ 20 km segments from the longest activities — grain is the SEGMENT, not the ride" ;
    rdfs:comment "Built on DEADBAND-SMOOTHED cells. The first version selected on raw h₋/km and was measuring altimeter noise: its target (2.4 m/km) sat below the corpus noise rate (3.1 m/km), so the search was self-reinforcing. Retracted and rebuilt." .

# The DEM/deployment thread (paper 2's inputs)
:o_igc a :Output ; dcterms:identifier "igc_resolution_test.csv" ; :input :i_dem ; :cardinality 922 ;
