    prov:wasDerivedFrom :o_e50 ; :gatedBy :gate ;
    rdfs:comment "Registered bar 0.50; ε explains 7% of prediction-error variance (C_dA 55%, m 46%) under BOTH registered boxes — the deficit research leaves paper 1 for future work and the paper ships a flat ε. A rejected ε box is the cautionary tale: derived per ride it gives S_T = 0.713 by construction, because 29% of rides admit NO physical ε (the residual is not ε-shaped). Bonus finding: the split inside α is unidentified — α's within-rider CV 0.154 vs C_dA's 0.451 — route energy identifies the flat resistance, not its rolling/aero division. Gate section 3p." .

