    prov:wasGeneratedBy :h_e56 ; :transformer :F3, :F4 ; :cardinality 4 ;
    :selection "grain is the STRUCTURAL PARAMETER (τ, c) with its ±10% loss inflation; profiles over the full range reported beside" .

:entry56 a :Statistic ; rdfs:label "Entry 56 — the method's own constants: τ 0.2%, c 0.1% at ±10%" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom :o_e56 ; :gatedBy :gate ;
    rdfs:comment "Both at the BOTTOM of the error budget (~200× below C_dA) — but local flatness is not global indifference: τ = 0 costs 77.3%, c = 3 costs 21.7%. The two halves must travel together: roughly right, then precision stops mattering. Also resolves Entry 55's τ-shift alarm: 2 → 6 m moved through a basin where the loss barely varies. Gate section 3s." .

:h_e57 a prov:Activity ; p-plan:correspondsToStep "src/harness/e57_rider_fallback.py" ; prov:used :o_e52_aggregates .
