    :selection "grain is the RIDER: train-half-only medians of the genuinely inverted m̂/Ĉrr/ĈdA, fed back into e52_build (which must be re-run after — the chain's one loop)" .

:entry57 a :Statistic ; rdfs:label "Entry 57 — rider-median fallbacks: no ride wears a global prior" ;
