    :selection "grain is the (form × parameter) interval: stratified bootstrap within rider, B = 400, seed 50, refitting each replicate" .

:entry58 a :Statistic ; rdfs:label "Entry 58 — parameter CIs and the 50%-loss breaking points" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom :o_e58 ;
    rdfs:comment "ε = 0.294 [0.285, 0.304]; τ grid-valued [4.5, 6.6]. Tolerances: C_dA 0.89–1.10×, ε 0.22–1.79×. Two bugs found under published numbers: logratio silently changed its population with ε (fixed: the population is set once across the search range — ε 0.2918 → 0.2939), and an id()-keyed cache answered for recycled throwaway dicts, making every breaking point read exactly 1.00×. Never memoise on id()." .

:h_e59 a prov:Activity ; p-plan:correspondsToStep "src/harness/e59_pooling.py" ; prov:used :o_e52_aggregates .
