    :selection "grain is the (form × pooling objective) cell: ride-weighted / rider-weighted / rider-median, fitted on train, scored once on test" .

:entry59 a :Statistic ; rdfs:label "Entry 59 — rider-weighted pooling REFUTED; the incumbent objective stays" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom :o_e59 ;
    rdfs:comment "The registered 0.3–0.6 pp gain does not exist (~0.1 pp, sign flips across forms, nothing significant): the diagnostic that promised it ran through the TAU_PUB_I held-parameter bug, which inflated every per-rider optimum. Entry 54 corrected in the same stroke (−0.55 → +0.047 pp; worst donor D6-user_2, not user_1). The estimand argument stands ON PRINCIPLE; the data say it is worth 0.1 pp here." .

